# Labels of your answers (the choices). Short; the most specific rule wins. Same context as her line, plus {move}.

# ---------------- ask ----------------
@rule move.ask
on move.ask
- [Ask more about {thing}|Ask her to tell you more]

@rule move.ask.low
on move.ask
when kind=day low=yes
- [Ask what's wrong|Ask what's bothering her]

@rule move.ask.good
on move.ask
when kind=day mood=cheerful
- [Ask what's got her so happy|Ask what made her day]

@rule move.ask.gossip
on move.ask
when kind=gossip
- [Ask how it happened|Ask for the details|Ask how she found out]

@rule move.ask.heard
on move.ask
when kind=you how=heard|rumor
- [Ask who's saying that|Ask who told her]

@rule move.ask.saw
on move.ask
when kind=you how=witness
- [Ask what she saw|Ask how she feels about it]

@rule move.ask.us
on move.ask
when kind=us
- [Ask how she felt about it|Ask what she thought]

@rule move.ask.like
on move.ask
when kind=small likes=yes
- [Ask what she loves about {like}|Ask how she got into {like}]

@rule move.ask.school
on move.ask
when kind=school
- [Ask about her plans|Ask what she's expecting]

# ---------------- comfort ----------------
@rule move.comfort
on move.comfort
- [Tell her it'll be okay|Reassure her]

@rule move.comfort.stress
on move.comfort
when mood=stressed
- [Say she's doing her best|Tell her not to push herself]

@rule move.comfort.lonely
on move.comfort
when mood=lonely
- [Say you're here now|Tell her she's not alone]

@rule move.comfort.upset
on move.comfort
when mood=upset
- [Just stay with her|Say she doesn't have to talk]

@rule move.comfort.fight
on move.comfort
when realverb=fought|insulted|broke_up
- [Say it'll blow over|Tell her it's not her fault]

@rule move.comfort.hurt
on move.comfort
when kind=you rel=girlfriend|lover
- [Tell her she matters to you|Take her hand]

# ---------------- share ----------------
@rule move.share
on move.share
- [Share your own take|Tell her what you think]

@rule move.share.day
on move.share
when kind=day
- [Tell her about your day|Share how your day went]

@rule move.share.us
on move.share
when kind=us
- [Say you liked it too|Tell her how you felt]

@rule move.share.like
on move.share
when kind=small likes=yes|no
- [Say what you think of {like}|Share your own taste]

# ---------------- tease ----------------
@rule move.tease
on move.tease
- [Tease her a little|Poke fun at her]

@rule move.tease.sleepy
on move.tease
when mood=sleepy
- [Tease her about dozing off|Call her a sleepyhead]

@rule move.tease.hungry
on move.tease
when mood=hungry
- [Tease her about her appetite|Joke about her stomach]

@rule move.tease.couple
on move.tease
when realverb=started_dating|crush|seen_together
- [Tease her about the couple|Ask if she's jealous]

@rule move.tease.us
on move.tease
when kind=us romance=yes
- [Tease her about blushing|Say she's cute when flustered]

@rule move.tease.you
on move.tease
when kind=you
- [Ask if she liked what she saw|Joke about it]

# ---------------- praise ----------------
@rule move.praise
on move.praise
- [Compliment her|Say something nice]

@rule move.praise.day
on move.praise
when kind=day mood=cheerful
- [Say her smile suits her|Say it's nice seeing her happy]

@rule move.praise.club
on move.praise
when hasclub=yes kind=school
- [Praise her work at the {club}|Say the {club} is lucky to have her]

# ---------------- invite ----------------
@rule move.invite
on move.invite
- [Suggest doing something together|Ask if she wants to hang out]

@rule move.invite.food
on move.invite
when mood=hungry
- [Offer to get food together|Offer to share your lunch]

@rule move.invite.bored
on move.invite
when mood=bored
- [Suggest something fun|Offer to break the boredom]

@rule move.invite.study
on move.invite
when exam=yes
- [Offer to study together|Suggest a study session]

@rule move.invite.event
on move.invite
when kind=school school=event
- [Ask her to go with you|Suggest going together]

@rule move.invite.again
on move.invite
when kind=us
- [Suggest doing it again|Ask for a next time]

@rule move.invite.like
on move.invite
when likes=yes
- [Invite her to do {like} together|Suggest {like} after school]

# ---------------- the rest ----------------
@rule move.correct
on move.correct
- [Tell her what really happened|Set the story straight|Say that's not how it went]

@rule move.agree
on move.agree
- [Agree with her|Nod along]

@rule move.defend
on move.defend
- [Stick up for {who}|Say {who} isn't like that|Defend {who}]

@rule move.laugh
on move.laugh
- [Laugh it off|Make a joke of it]

@rule move.admit
on move.admit
- [Admit it|Own up to it]

@rule move.admit.close
on move.admit
when rel=girlfriend|lover kind=you
- [Tell her the truth|Apologize and come clean]

@rule move.hush
on move.hush
- [Ask her to keep it quiet|Ask her not to tell anyone]

@rule move.deny
on move.deny
- [Deny it|Say she's mistaken|Play dumb]

@rule move.thank
on move.thank
- [Thank her|Say thanks]

@rule move.change
on move.change
- [Change the subject|Talk about something else]
